erm is $-\\dfrac{1}{2}s,$ and\n\n- the fourth term is $8t.$\n\nIn particular, we are interested in the fourth term. The fourth term is $8t.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186078615 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f72b7910-f317-5fd4-bdc7-ea9bd6020aca" "question-3e6d4984-6930-5fe6-93df-11f6e79d298e" "question-dbc37bd7-5361-53f4-8dd7-bb74cc1fe395"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186078160 :question/problem "Write down an expression that is equivalent to $9-\\dfrac{1}{2}x+3y.$" :question/worked-solution "The expression $9-\\dfrac{1}{2}x+3y$ has three terms: $9,$ $-\\dfrac{1}{2}x,$ and $3y.$\n\nIt doesn't matter in what order we write the terms. For example, one equivalent expression is:\n\n$$\n-\\dfrac{1}{2}x + 3y +9\n$$\n\nAnother equivalent expression is:\n\n$$\n3y - \\dfrac{1}{2}x + 9\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-1c4f91a4-4262-52d4-9997-898e6ff332bc" :question/id #uuid "1c4f91a4-4262-52d4-9997-898e6ff332bc" :question/math-academy-id "q-176815" :question/problem "What are the terms of the expression $10m+3n?$" :question/worked-solution "The expression $10m+3n$ has two terms:  $10m$ and $3n.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9b8b7c37-1e16-5236-8309-39931684a2c1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9b8b7c37-1e16-5236-8309-39931684a2c1" :answer-field/id #uuid "9b8b7c37-1e16-5236-8309-39931684a2c1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3768fd23-303b-5476-af4f-490538e93c0a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-bf046111-9f3f-5f58-ac4a-f3c86aab9822" "answer-a65a1fbc-69c1-527d-9683-130467c04658" "answer-3768fd23-303b-5476-af4f-490538e93c0a" "answer-d66ff883-3c52-5898-ae19-6b2bdc746247" "answer-6da27a7f-d249-575a-b7b0-c40ea354bf7b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bf046111-9f3f-5f58-ac4a-f3c86aab9822" :answer/id #uuid "bf046111-9f3f-5f58-ac4a-f3c86aab982